1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,333
Human versus AI. Who really has the edge?

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:07,208
I can process text and generate ideas in seconds.

3
00:00:07,208 --> 00:00:11,667
I bring lived experience, feelings, and personal context.

4
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,125
I can remix patterns into new possibilities.

5
00:00:15,125 --> 00:00:18,833
I bring purpose, taste, and a reason to create.

6
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:21,875
I can sound confident and still be wrong.

7
00:00:21,875 --> 00:00:26,083
So I question, verify, and take responsibility.

8
00:00:26,083 --> 00:00:30,375
The strongest team? Human judgment, with AI assistance.
